   c_\theta  c_\psi  c_\phi - s_\psi  s_\phi & - c_\theta  c_\phi  s_\psi - c_\psi  s_\phi & c_\phi  s_\theta \\
   c_\theta  c_\psi  s_\phi + c_\phi  s_\psi & - c_\theta  s_\psi  s_\phi + c_\psi  c_\phi & s_\theta  s_\phi \\
